# Custom
scripts/**
!scripts/runMigrations.ts
# `npm run build` runs `build:marketplace` -> `tsx scripts/generateMarketplaceBundles.ts`
# (TM-1), so these two must reach the BUILD context or the image build dies with
# ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND at /app/scripts/generateMarketplaceBundles.ts. That is exactly
# what happened: every `dev` deploy from 2026-08-16 to 2026-08-18 failed this way and
# the environment silently kept serving the last good build. No test can catch it —
# the repo tree always has `scripts/`; only the Docker build context does not.
# Keep this list in sync with the generator's own imports.
!scripts/generateMarketplaceBundles.ts
!scripts/curatedWorkflowSchema.ts
custom-scripts
uploads
*.test.ts
*.spec.ts
